[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7680.069, "timestamp": "02:08:00", "text": "你觉得十年后自己会在哪里？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7682.55, "timestamp": "02:08:02", "text": "大概五年多吧？将要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7685.27, "timestamp": "02:08:05", "text": "你什么时候毕业？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7689.069, "timestamp": "02:08:09", "text": "某物？虚拟管家或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7691.91, "timestamp": "02:08:11", "text": "嗯，你会在生活中找到另一半吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7694.39, "timestamp": "02:08:14", "text": "并让他们也以 YouTuber 的身份出现。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 7696.79, "timestamp": "02:08:16", "author": "@notSojasu", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/9iC0_w5nBHNC4BhGgiYeUdW6ZfCOGIbrmqCvaFZ2PV9zycbIf4HhyAZJDeqpX-v3fXW6q93S=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "this is a whole ass job interview not a Collab stream"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7698.51, "timestamp": "02:08:18", "text": "在你的直播间里之类的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7701.669, "timestamp": "02:08:21", "text": "或者你打算什么时候推出一位运动健将？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7703.709, "timestamp": "02:08:23", "text": "那"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 7708.052, "timestamp": "02:08:28", "author": "@zergrush78319", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_nDwl-xtQg1-Z5v6Iv64Z42_Hei-15daYPmWXqoFR-4_b8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "what was the question?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7708.31, "timestamp": "02:08:28", "text": "事物？嗯，生活中很多事情，或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7711.75, "timestamp": "02:08:31", "text": "调音方面。嗯，我的意思是答案是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7714.47, "timestamp": "02:08:34", "text": "这个问题嗯……我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7716.709, "timestamp": "02:08:36", "text": "最意想不到的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7718.39, "timestamp": "02:08:38", "text": "好的。你看不见的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7721.589, "timestamp": "02:08:41", "text": "未来。好的。看，来了。是的。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7723.91, "timestamp": "02:08:43", "text": "有人说，好吧，那就干一整份工作吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7726.149, "timestamp": "